        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for LibVNCServer fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-50538: a malicious (or man-in-the-middle) VNC server can force a connecting `libvncclient` to write attacker-\n  controlled data past the end of its framebuffer (bsc#1276218).\n",
